WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.400
[Electronic music: Cascade Breathe by NverAvetyanMusic]

00:01.000 --> 00:09.000
[Wheel motors hum as P2 drives in]

00:09.000 --> 00:09.600
[Whir and a click as the feet lower]

00:09.700 --> 00:14.000
[The edger pad brushes along the ceiling line]

00:14.200 --> 00:21.400
[The roller rolls on the wall while the lift hums]

00:22.900 --> 00:26.200
[A click each time a tool locks]

00:26.800 --> 00:30.800
[The roller rolls the last lane]

00:31.000 --> 00:34.000
[The music fades out]
